Local thin-film optical mathematics adapted from pyElli revision4a8787654477355167df74bbf0b6003e8fc35a4d by Marius J. Mueller, Sangam Chatterjee and Florian Dobener, GPL-3.0. The full upstream GPL-3.0 license is retained in LICENSE. The acquisition is author-provided real Sentech TiO2 ellipsometry; source authors describe the fixed oxide values as from a separate substrate fit, whose original observation is not supplied. No independent material truth or full calibration provenance is invented. Separate measurement redistribution terms were not identified; local private research staging does not assert an additional data grant.

Silicon literature calibration is adapted from the Aspnes–Studna entry of refractiveindex.info-database revision991323d19f5bc993d6de1a65a2f1f5dd4c387897 (CC0-1.0). Public-domain database terms: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/ . Retain the original Aspnes–Studna1983 citation in README. No whole database is shipped.

